#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:2 7384f942b5244e0db35187c934a86bf9
msgid "InfoClient"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:5 e81ecd4b90c745c7b7b87db72bc9b4e3
msgid "Shared contract"
msgstr "共享契约"

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:7 91484d1a86fe447481caf98db3e0b8f7
msgid ""
"Info methods return the typed wire shape and do not require credentials. "
"Account addresses are query parameters; they do not become client state."
msgstr "Info 方法返回带类型的 wire 结构，且不需要凭据。账户地址是查询参数；不会成为客户端状态。"

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:10 c83944ae59554bf497fbf87f5211b220
msgid ""
"Use an async context manager, or pair ``open()`` with ``close()``. "
"Passing an existing ``aiohttp`` session leaves that session owned by the "
"caller."
msgstr ""
"请使用 async 上下文管理器，或配对调用 ``open()`` 与 ``close()``。传入现有 ``aiohttp`` session "
"时，该 session 仍由调用方所有。"

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:12 ae22ec1315ee4ca0af0f8e63cd7497f7
msgid ""
"Timestamps are integer milliseconds. Numeric fields in protocol-shaped "
"responses remain strings unless a named convenience method, such as "
"``mark_price()`` or ``mid_price()``, declares a numeric return type."
msgstr ""
"时间戳为整数毫秒。协议结构响应中的数字字段保持为字符串，除非 ``mark_price()`` 或 ``mid_price()`` "
"等具名便捷方法声明了数字返回类型。"

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:15 c1fbde4cd2c048f58b253c7db6342d3e
msgid ""
"Metadata helpers cache one coherent metadata snapshot. Call "
"``refresh_metadata()`` when the application explicitly needs fresh "
"listings. Separate Info requests are not an atomic account snapshot."
msgstr ""
"元数据 helper 会缓存一个一致的元数据快照。当应用明确需要最新上市信息时调用 ``refresh_metadata()``。分开的 Info"
" 请求不是原子账户快照。"

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:18 2cbbf99b5c2442c1b84b1425d5912398
msgid ""
"Local argument errors raise ``ValueError``; transport failures and "
"malformed upstream shapes raise the package exceptions in :doc:`errors`."
msgstr "本地参数错误会抛出 ``ValueError``；传输失败和上游结构错误会抛出 :doc:`errors` 中的包异常。"

#: ../../reference/info-client.rst:21 ca8cdf277d9f4fc7a0f9e6527ae038df
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`../howto/info-queries` to choose an endpoint by task and "
":doc:`../howto/markets` for canonical coin names. The signatures below "
"remain the authoritative parameter and return-type reference."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`../howto/info-queries` 按任务选择端点，并通过 :doc:`../howto/markets` 了解规范 "
"coin 名称。下方签名仍是参数和返回类型的权威参考。"

#: 3cdf651a80ba4df388eba046fe986a7c async_hyperliquid.info.InfoClient:1 of
msgid "Asynchronous, credential-free client for Hyperliquid Info endpoints."
msgstr ""

